#. module: alc_eshop_cms
#: model:alc.eshop.cms.page,content:alc_eshop_cms.alc_eshop_cms_page_tailor-made-setup
msgid ""
"\n"
"<h1>My tailor-made set-up</h1>\n"
"<p>Created by and for vets, ALCYON Belux will assist you throughout your "
"career. Setting up constitutes the first stage of a long-term, high-quality "
"partnership. Your Alcyon teams are available for advising and assisting you "
"towards a successful outcome for your project in numerous areas.</p>\n"
"<h2>Alcyon equipment</h2>\n"
"<p>ALCYON Belux’ equipment department offers you a range of high-quality "
"medical equipment. Our range is constantly kept up to date and benefits from "
"the most recent technologies available on the market. We visit international "
"trade fairs and are constantly seeking out the most modern equipment and in "
"particular the equipment that is best adapted to your needs and your "
"financial resources.</p>\n"
"<p>Thus, ALCYON Belux ensures efficient and speedy after-sales service for "
"you.</p>\n"
"<p>We can help you to find funding sources, if that proves necessary. ALCYON "
"Belux is not a mere supplier. We’re your partner!</p>\n"
"<h2>Who do i need to contact to prepare my surgery and optimise my equipment?"
"</h2>\n"
"<p>Contact your Advisory Rep, whose details you can find below or get from "
"our call centre.</p>\n"
"<p>Your rep will take the time to draw up a list with you of the equipment "
"you really need and will help optimise your budget. Please do not hesitate "
"to contact us to get an offer:</p>\n"
"<p><strong>RUDY NEIRYNCK</strong><br/> E-mail : <a href=\"mailto:rudy."
"neirynck@alcyonbelux.be\">rudy.neirynck@alcyonbelux.be</a></p>\n"
"<p>And for any other questions - financial, marketing, etc. Please do not "
"hesitate to contact the Alcyon secretariat directly and/or your delegate. We "
"can help you or refer you to specialists in each of the areas you need!</p>\n"
"<p>By email: <a href=\"mailto:secretariat@alcyonbelux.be"
"\">secretariat@alcyonbelux.be</a><br/> By phone: 04/338.34.90</p>\n"
"<h1>After-sales service</h1>\n"
"<p>Created by and for vets, ALCYON Belux will assist you throughout your "
"career. Your surgery and your equipment - essential components allowing you "
"to exercise your profession effectively and with peace of mind.</p>\n"
"<h2>First-line intervention</h2>\n"
"<p>The Alcyon equipment department will immediately assist you in the event "
"of any problems in order either to find an immediate solution as far as "
"possible or to monitor the intervention of the specialist in question.</p>\n"
"<p>ALCYON will follow up on repairs in the maintenance contracts, which we "
"strongly recommend taking out when making your investment.</p>\n"
"<h2>Follow-up on warranties</h2>\n"
"<p>In accordance with each supplier’s own conditions, ALCYON Belux can guide "
"you and assist you in order to ensure that the supplier gives you the help "
"you need as quickly as possible and under the best possible conditions. "
"ALCYON Belux can be limited in its actions by a supplier’s specific terms "
"and conditions.</p>\n"
"<h2>Replacement equipment</h2>\n"
"<p>Given the range and variety of the equipment made available to you, it is "
"clearly impossible for ALCYON to have replacement equipment permanently "
"available. However, we always do our very best to try to sort you out while "
"your own equipment is unavailable.</p>\n"
"<p>For your after-sales service, please contact:</p>\n"
"<p>By email: <a href=\"mailto:Erik.Hoitinga@alcyonbelux.be\">Erik."
"Hoitinga@alcyonbelux.be</a><br/> By phone: 0470/60.06.14</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Mon installation sur-mesure</h1>\n"
"<p>Créée par et pour les vétérinaires, ALCYON Belux vous accompagne tout au "
"long de votre vie professionnelle.</p>\n"
"<p>Votre installation représente la première étape d'un partenariat de "
"qualité basé sur le long terme. Vos équipes Alcyon sont disponibles pour "
"vous conseiller et vous accompagner vers la réussite de votre projet et ce "
"dans de nombreux domaines.</p>\n"
"<h2>Le matériel alcyon</h2>\n"
"<p>Le département matériel d'ALCYON Belux vous propose une gamme complète de "
"matériel médical de qualité. Notre gamme est constamment mise à jour et "
"enrichie des dernières technologies disponibles sur le marché. Nous visitons "
"les foires internationales et recherchons sans cesse le matériel le plus "
"moderne et surtout le plus adapté à vos besoins et à vos moyens.</p>\n"
"<p>ALCYON Belux vous assure aussi un Service Après-vente (SAV) efficace et "
"rapide !</p>\n"
"<p>Nous pouvons vous aider à trouver des sources de financement si cela "
"s’avère nécessaire, ALCYON Belux n’est pas un simple fournisseur mais bien "
"votre partenaire !</p>\n"
"<h2>Qui dois-je contacter pour préparer mon cabinet et optimiser mon "
"matériel ?</h2>\n"
"<p>Contactez votre Délégué Conseil dont vous trouverez toutes les "
"coordonnées ci-dessous ou notre centrale téléphonique.</p>\n"
"<p>Votre délégué prendra le temps d'établir avec vous la liste de matériel "
"dont vous avez réellement besoin et optimisera votre budget. N’hésitez pas à "
"nous contacter pour obtenir une offre :</p>\n"
"<p><strong> FABRICE HEYMANN </strong><br> Verviers, Liège, Namur, Hainaut, "
"BW, Bruxelles<br> Tél. : 0470 / 32 04 11<br> Email : fabrice."
"heymann@alcyonbelux.be</p>\n"
"<p><strong> RAYMOND PIRARD </strong> <br> Wallonie Sud et Est<br> Tél. : "
"0475 / 36 57 24<br> Email : raymond.pirard@alcyonbelux.be</p>\n"
"<p>Et pour d’autres questions : financier, marketing…</p>\n"
"<p>N’hésitez pas à contacter directement le secrétariat d’Alcyon et/ou votre "
"délégué. Nous pourrons vous aider ou vous conseiller des spécialistes dans "
"chacun des domaines recherchés !</p>\n"
"<p>Par mail : secretariat@alcyonbelux.be<br> Par téléphone : 04/338.34.90</"
"p>\n"
"<h1>Service après-vente</h1>\n"
"<p>Créée par et pour les vétérinaires, ALCYON Belux vous accompagne tout au "
"long de votre vie professionnelle.</p>\n"
"<p>Votre cabinet, votre matériel constituent des éléments essentiels pour "
"pouvoir exercer votre métier sereinement et efficacement !</p>\n"
"<h2>Intervention de premiere ligne</h2>\n"
"<p>Le département matériel d'ALCYON Belux vous assistera immédiatement en "
"cas de problèmes pour soit trouver une solution immédiate dans la mesure du "
"possible soit assurer le suivi de l’intervention du spécialiste concerné.</"
"p>\n"
"<p>ALCYON Belux assure le suivi des réparations dans le cadre de ses "
"contrats de maintenance que nous vous invitons vivement à souscrire lors de "
"votre investissement !</p>\n"
"<h2>Suivi des garanties</h2>\n"
"<p>En fonction des conditions propres à chaque fournisseur ALCYON Belux "
"pourra vous guider et vous assister pour assurer l’intervention du "
"fournisseur dans les meilleurs délais et les meilleures conditions. L’action "
"d’ALCYON peut être limitée par les conditions spécifiques du fournisseur.</"
"p>\n"
"<h2>Matériel de remplacement</h2>\n"
"<p>Vu la richesse et la variété du matériel mis à votre disposition il est "
"évidemment impossible pour ALCYON Belux de disposer en permanence de "
"matériel de substitution. Mais en fonction de nos moyens, ALCYON Belux fera "
"toujours l’impossible pour tenter de vous dépanner au mieux durant une "
"période d’indisponibilité de votre matériel.</p>\n"
"<p>Pour votre Service après-vente, contactez :</p>\n"
"<p>Par mail : Erik.Hoitinga@alcyonbelux.be<br> Par téléphone : "
"0470/60.06.14</p>"

#. module: alc_eshop_cms
#: model:alc.eshop.cms.page,content:alc_eshop_cms.alc_eshop_cms_page_obligations-ordering-medication
msgid ""
"\n"
"<h1>Obligations to meet when ordering medication</h1>\n"
"<h2>For belgian veterinary practioners</h2>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Being the manager of a veterinary medical depot and having sent us the "
"number of the depot in question.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Being a registered and paid-up member of the Veterinary Practitioners’ "
"Association</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<h2>For belgian pharmacies and wholesalers</h2>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Being in possession of an APB number (for pharmacies) or a (933V) permit "
"for distributing veterinary medication (for wholesalers) and having "
"communicated this number/ permit to us.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<h2>Eligible persons outside of belgium</h2>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Please contact Alcyon in order to send a copy of a certificate/ degree/ "
"permit on an ad hoc basis.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>Royal Decree of 21 July 2016 relating to the conditions of use of "
"medicines by veterinary practitioners and those taking care of animals.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Obligations à remplir pour commander les médicaments</h1>\n"
"<h2>Pour les vétérinaires belges :</h2>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Etre le responsable d’un dépôt de médicaments vétérinaires, et nous "
"avoir communiqué le numéro de dépôt en question.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Etre en ordre d’inscription et de cotisation à l’Ordre des Médecins "
"Vétérinaires, et nous avoir communiqué le numéro d’ordre en question.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<h2>Pour les pharmacies et les grossistes belges :</h2>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Etre en possession d’un numéro APB (pour les pharmacies) ou d’une "
"autorisation (933V) de distribution de médicaments vétérinaires (pour les "
"grossistes), et nous avoir communiqué ce numéro/autorisation.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<h2>Pour les ayant droits hors Belgique :</h2>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Prendre contact avec Alcyon afin de faire parvenir une copie du "
"certificat/diplôme/autorisation ad hoc.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>Arrêté Royal du 21 juillet 2016 relatif aux conditions d’utilisation des "
"médicaments par les médecins vétérinaires et par les responsables des "
"animaux.</p>"

#. module: alc_eshop_cms
#: model:alc.eshop.cms.page,content:alc_eshop_cms.alc_eshop_cms_page_rgpd
msgid ""
"\n"
"<h1>Privacy and personal data confidentiality policy</h1>\n"
"<p>Alcyon is concerned with protecting the personal data that it processes. "
"To this end, Alcyon hereby commits to respect the enforceable regulations "
"applicable to processing of personal data and, particularly, EU regulation "
"2016/679 of the European Parliament and Council dated 27th April 2016 that "
"came into effect on 25th May 2018 (also known as the “general data "
"protection regulation”).</p>\n"
"<p>This privacy policy declaration aims to describe how Alcyon collects and "
"processes your personal data, whether within the scope of the assistance "
"which we provide to you for any questions you may ask us, the supply of your "
"data via a form, the provision of a service by ourselves or yourselves, your "
"application for a job vacancy or simply as part of our collaboration.</p>\n"
"<p>This privacy policy therefore applies to the personal data of applicants "
"for job vacancies, our customers, our suppliers, our various partners and "
"other persons that we may contact within the scope of developing our "
"business.</p>\n"
"<p>We would like to mention that we may be led to modify this Privacy / "
"Confidentiality policy. Please visit this page regularly to consult any "
"modifications that we may publish.</p>\n"
"<h2>1. What types of personal data do we collect?</h2>\n"
"<h3>1.1. Customers</h3>\n"
"<p>It is possible to visit an off-line part of our web site without sending "
"personal data to us. However, if you wish to become a customer and make "
"orders or if you wish to view our on-line catalogue, it is essential for us "
"to create a customer record for you and thus collect the following data "
"within the scope of creating a personalised customer record form:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Surname and first name(s)</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Company name and legal name</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>VAT number</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Invoicing address and delivery address</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>E-mail</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Telephone (and/or fax) number</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Depository number</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Order number</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Bank details if you wish to set up a direct debit</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Any other personal data that you have deliberately sent to us</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>We may also hold further information that a person from your company has "
"chosen to send to us. If we require further personal data, we shall inform "
"you of this fact.</p>\n"
"<h3>1.2. Suppliers / sub-contractors</h3>\n"
"<p>If you are a supplier or sub-contractor for Alcyon, we may need to "
"collect a limited amount of personal data which you provide. In principle, "
"Alcyon solely needs the contact details for the contact persons in your "
"company who are in charge of the contract or contracts into which your "
"company has entered with Alcyon in order to carry out management and follow-"
"up of such contracts. We shall therefore request the following data:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Surname and first name(s) of the contact person</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Company name and legal name</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>VAT number</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Invoicing address and delivery address</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>E-mail</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Telephone (and/or fax) number</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Any other personal data that you have deliberately sent to us</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>In certain cases, we may collect your bank information in order to pay "
"you if your account is not in the name of your company. We may also hold "
"further information that a person from your company has chosen to send to "
"us. If we require further personal data, we shall inform you of this fact.</"
"p>\n"
"<h3>1.3. Applicants for a job vacancy</h3>\n"
"<p>Within the scope of a job offer at Alcyon, we will be led to collect the "
"following data:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Surname and first name(s)</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Address</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Age / date of birth</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Birth number</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Gender</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Photograph</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Marital status</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Contact details</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Qualifications</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Professional experience</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Immigration status (necessity of a work permit or not)</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Nationality / citizenship / place of birth</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>A copy of your driving licence and/or passport or identity card</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Your social security number and other fiscal information</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Information related to diversity, including racial or ethnic origin, "
"religion or other similar beliefs, and to physical or mental health, "
"including information related to handicaps.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Information on any criminal conviction if such information is required "
"for the post for which you are applying.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Information on your current salary, your pension plan and your social "
"benefits.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Information on your centres of interest and needs concerning your future "
"job.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Any further information that you choose to send to us.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Any further information concerning you that our customers / partners may "
"send to us.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Any personal data that you have deliberately sent to us.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>Please note that the above list of personal data categories that we may "
"collect is not exhaustive.</p>\n"
"<h2>2. How is the personal data collected?</h2>\n"
"<h3>2.1. Customers / suppliers / partners</h3>\n"
"<p>We receive personal data directly from you in two ways:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>When you contact us pro-actively, generally by telephone or by e-mail.</"
