"<ul>\n"
"<li>ID / password</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Firewalls</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<p>We undertake to maintain a high degree of confidentiality by integrating "
"the latest technological innovations to guarantee the confidentiality of "
"your transactions. However, as no mechanism provides maximum safety, there "
"is always some risk when using Internet to send personal details.</p>\n"
"<h2>Label</h2>\n"
